"},{id:"build",anchor:"stage-build",title:"Start in Build",body:"Everything you author lives here — cards, decks, boards, print sheets.",placement:"bottom",clickToAdvance:!0,clickLabel:"Build"},{id:"build-cards",anchor:"build-cards",title:"Cards go in a spreadsheet",body:"One row per card — type across it like any spreadsheet, or switch to Gallery to see the art. Paste a block straight in from Sheets and it creates the rows it needs.",placement:"right",awaitAnchor:!0},{id:"build-templates",anchor:"build-templates-tab",title:"Templates do the design",body:"A card holds the words; its template is the layout they render in. Change the template once and every card wearing it follows — that’s the whole trick.",placement:"bottom",clickToAdvance:!0,clickLabel:"Templates",awaitAnchor:!0},{id:"template-blank",anchor:"template-blank",title:"Make one",body:"Start from blank and we’ll put a field on it. (Your existing templates sit alongside — this won’t disturb them.)",placement:"right",clickToAdvance:!0,clickLabel:"Blank template",awaitAnchor:!0},{id:"template-size",anchor:"template-size",title:"Pick a size first",body:"These match real card stock, so whatever you design comes out print-ready. Poker is the safe default; Custom takes millimetres if your game needs something else — fill those in and hit Create.",placement:"left",advanceWhenAnchor:"addfield-name",clickLabel:"a size",awaitAnchor:!0},{id:"template-fields",anchor:"addfield-name",title:"Add a field",body:"This strip adds elements to the card: Name, Text, Number, an image, a shape, an icon. Click Name — it binds to each card’s name, so every card fills it in with its own.",placement:"right",clickToAdvance:!0,clickLabel:"Name",awaitAnchor:!0},{id:"template-drag",anchor:"template-canvas",title:"Move it where you want it",body:"Drag the field you just added anywhere on the card — grab a corner to resize it. Snap keeps things aligned to the grid; hold it off with the toggle above if you want fine control.",placement:"lef